# Scene1-3-13

; ========================================
; ●シーン1‐3‐13
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:16_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_28_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL9
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:啊～太棒了～|#0103Adv13_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呼、呼、呼……|#0103Adv13_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然汉娜和雪莉飞得很远，<br>但最后还是走路回来了。|#0103Adv13_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜，辛苦了……|#0103Adv13_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我这就给你倒茶。<br>虽然已经凉了……|#0103Adv13_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:凉的就好……<br>雪莉可真会指导人锻炼身体啊，哼。|#0103Adv13_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:四个人再次坐在餐布上，<br>气氛变得悠闲起来。|#0103Adv13_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（要是这样的时光能一直持续下去就好了……）|#0103Adv13_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:话说，艾玛。|#0103Adv13_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉发起了对话，<br>艾玛慢悠悠地看向了她。|#0103Adv13_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:什么事？|#0103Adv13_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你和二阶堂希罗<br>是什么关系呢？|#0103Adv13_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看起来很不一般呢？<br>有什么过节吗？|#0103Adv13_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:呃……|#0103Adv13_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的表情瞬间变得僵硬。|#0103Adv13_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:等等，雪莉！<br>有你这样问的吗……！|#0103Adv13_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们对彼此的事情还几乎一无所知，<br>特别是被关在这里之前的事。|#0103Adv13_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:既然是朋友，<br>想要更多地了解对方不是很正常吗？|#0103Adv13_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这倒是……没错，但是……|#0103Adv13_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（被关在这里之前的事……<br>　我的确还不是很了解大家）|#0103Adv13_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我也想多些了解大家，<br>　也希望大家多了解我）|#0103Adv13_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:——我从小就认识希罗了。|#0103Adv13_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，这个我听说过。|#0103Adv13_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:我们曾经是朋友，<br>但不知为什么，我被她讨厌了……|#0103Adv13_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然是我的错，但我对那段时期的记忆<br>记得不太清楚。<br>所以不太明白原因。|#0103Adv13_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只记得，<br>我惹怒了身为校园中心人物的希罗，<br>然后就被大家孤立了。|#0103Adv13_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……总感觉，<br>被大家霸凌了。|#0103Adv13_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL11
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:这是怎么回事！？<br>太过分了……！|#0103Adv13_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐……竟然经历了这么痛苦的事……呜呜……|#0103Adv13_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也就是说，<br>是希罗鼓动的吧？<br>变成了霸凌者和受霸凌者的关系……？|#0103Adv13_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:也许是这样吧，但那只是关系变糟了而已……<br>即使现在，希罗在我心目中依然很特别。|#0103Adv13_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没想到会在这里再会，<br>然后出了那样的事……|#0103Adv13_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:直到现在，<br>艾玛的口袋里还揣着希罗掉落的钢笔。|#0103Adv13_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛轻轻握紧那支钢笔。|#0103Adv13_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（现在有雪莉、汉娜、<br>　还有梅露露在我身边）|#0103Adv13_Ema014|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢大家愿意听我说。<br>感觉轻松了一些。|#0103Adv13_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:人际关系总是很复杂呢……<br>我也有过被大家无视的经历。|#0103Adv13_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你这种性格，确实有这种经历也不奇怪。|#0103Adv13_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么对我和艾玛的态度差这么多！？<br>我可要哭了哦？|#0103Adv13_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，汉娜呢？<br>在被关在这里之前<br>过着怎样的生活呢？|#0103Adv13_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？我、我吗……？|#0103Adv13_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:似乎没想到会被问到，<br>汉娜的举止变得慌乱起来。|#0103Adv13_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我是……那个……看就知道了吧！？<br>我、我是有钱人家的大小姐！|#0103Adv13_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被当成掌上明珠宠爱着！<br>每天过着奢侈的生活！真怀念以前的生活啊！|#0103Adv13_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯～感觉很可疑呢……<br>吃相和举止都很像平民……|#0103Adv13_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我的事就不用说了吧！？<br>雪莉你是怎样的？|#0103Adv13_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR7

[PrintTextModified Text:我吗？<br>哎呀呀，汉娜想了解我吗？|#0103Adv13_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这么感兴趣我很伤脑筋呢～<br>如果这么想知道的话，我就告诉你吧～？|#0103Adv13_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:明明是你先问的！<br>别总是这样挑衅啊！|#0103Adv13_Hanna011| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR12

[PrintTextModified Text:好吧，我来说说！|#0103Adv13_Sherry015| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:我……嗯……小学和初中<br>都是很普通的孩子呢……！|#0103Adv13_Sherry016| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要说的话，就是迷上了悬疑小说，<br>变成了悬疑宅而已……|#0103Adv13_Sherry017| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:这种事一看就知道了……|#0103Adv13_Hanna012| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:抱歉内容比想像中无聊～！|#0103Adv13_Sherry018| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:就算无聊也没关系的，<br>雪莉……|#0103Adv13_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，不过有一件事。<br>我是孤儿，在福利机构长大的。|#0103Adv13_Sherry019| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以和养父母没有血缘关系。|#0103Adv13_Sherry020| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉轻描淡写地说出这番话，<br>让艾玛她们都说不出话来。|#0103Adv13_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:突、突然扔下这样的重磅炸弹……|#0103Adv13_Hanna013| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为关系算不上特别好，<br>我想我的家人应该不会担心我。|#0103Adv13_Sherry021| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:……不、不会的！|#0103Adv13_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露罕见地提高了声音。<br>她浑身颤抖，似乎随时都要哭出来。|#0103Adv13_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（梅露露……？）|#0103Adv13_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使没有血缘关系，<br>家人也是重要的存在……|#0103Adv13_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉小姐的家人，<br>一定很担心雪莉小姐……|#0103Adv13_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:每天都在想念着雪莉小姐，<br>心都要碎了。|#0103Adv13_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:或许是再也无法忍受，<br>梅露露不禁泪如雨下。|#0103Adv13_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Cry

[PrintTextModified Text:我……想见家人。|#0103Adv13_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆泣いてしゃくりあげながら

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经受够这里了……<br>我好想见她，好想见啊……呜呜呜～|#0103Adv13_Meruru008| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露，别哭了……|#0103Adv13_Hanna014| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露……|#0103Adv13_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露平时虽然胆小，<br>但从未在他人面前展示内心的脆弱。<br>|#0103Adv13_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而此刻，<br>她却抽泣着，倾吐出内心的情感。|#0103Adv13_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:心如刀割。<br>所有少女都怀着同样的心情。|#0103Adv13_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——想见家人。|#0103Adv13_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:……放风时间快结束了。<br>我们回去吧。|#0103Adv13_Sherry022| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:气氛变得沉重，<br>艾玛她们开始准备返回监牢。|#0103Adv13_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:Sherry Category:Profile Version:3

